<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MIDF 6-mth net profit up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MIDF 6-mth net profit up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  75.47   vs	  56.33</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 11.92   vs	  13.90</p>
<p>    Net interest income    168.19   vs	 122.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   143.64   vs	  98.89</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   18.12   vs  less  11.42</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    1.25   vs	   0.34</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Industrial Development Finance Bhd is in financial services business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
